;; Verified public-register citations for the legal entity archived by this repository.
;;
;; Every row is checked live by tools/verify_citations.cljs:
;;   * GET :cite/url must answer HTTP 2xx
;;   * :cite/expect-substring must appear in the response body
;;
;; A URL that cannot be fetched, or whose body no longer carries the claim, is a
;; DRIFT and fails the gate. Nothing is recorded here that was not retrieved.
;;
;; THREE independent authorities are cited, not one:
;;   * GLEIF, the global LEI system
;;   * the United States, via the SEC's EDGAR submissions API (HDFC Bank is a
;;     foreign private issuer, NYSE ticker HDB, CIK 0001144967)
;;   * the issuer itself, at its own published website www.hdfc.bank.in -- the
;;     domain sits in the .bank.in zone the Reserve Bank of India reserved for
;;     Indian banks, but that zone policy is not itself cited (no per-entity
;;     GET URL publishes the zone's allocation records)
;;
;; WHY THE INDIAN REGISTER OF RECORD IS NOT CITED. GLEIF names RA000394 -- the
;; Companies Register kept by the Ministry of Corporate Affairs -- as BOTH the
;; register of record and the validation authority for this entity (rows
;; gleif-registered-at and gleif-validated-at). That register publishes no
;; per-entity GET URL: www.mca.gov.in answered HTTP 403 to this gate's client
;; when measured (2026-08-22), and the per-entity "View Company Master Data"
;; lookup runs behind POST/captcha flows this gate cannot replay. NSE and BSE
;; quote pages were considered and not cited: both sit behind POST/JS-gated
;; APIs, and a search page that echoes the query is not a citation. So the
;; entity's own Indian company number (CIN L65920MH1994PLC080618) rests on
;; GLEIF alone. What the catalog does instead is corroborate the entity through
;; a second STATE authority that does answer on stable URLs:
;;
;;   GLEIF says the legal seat is HDFC BANK HOUSE, Senapati Bapat Marg, Lower
;;   Parel (West), Mumbai 400013 (rows gleif-address, gleif-city, gleif-postal)
;;   -> the SEC prints 'HDFC BANK HOUSE', SENAPATI BAPAT ROAD / LOWER PAREL
;;   (WEST), MUMBAI INDIA in its own business-address record (rows sec-street,
;;   sec-street2). GLEIF records the legal name HDFC BANK LIMITED -> EDGAR
;;   prints HDFC BANK LTD as the registrant name, incorporated in India,
;;   NYSE ticker HDB. The SEC and GLEIF never consulted each other.
;;
;; WHAT IS DELIBERATELY NOT CITED. GLEIF's nextRenewalDate and lastUpdateDate
;; move by construction; a row on either would go red on schedule while saying
;; nothing about the entity, so they are left out. The RBI's bank-licence
;; records publish no stable per-entity GET URL and are not cited.
;;
;; :cite/row-kind is the honest part of this catalog and should be read before
;; the claims:
;;
;;   :identity   the substring names this entity, its identifiers, or a specific
;;               related legal entity (the four direct children, the ADS ISIN).
;;               Point the URL at a different company and the row fails.
;;   :attribute  the substring is TRUE OF THIS ENTITY BUT NOT ONLY OF IT (status
;;               ACTIVE, country IN, city MUMBAI, SIC 6029). Such a row can
;;               survive a swap to a similar company. It is recorded because it
;;               is checked and true, not because it identifies.
;;   :definition the row resolves a code used by another row (RA000394, NBCI,
;;               the managing LOU). It says the named register, legal form or
;;               LEI issuer exists; it says nothing about HDFC Bank.
;;
;; Of the entries below, 27 are :identity, 26 are :attribute and 8 are
;; :definition. A reader who treats all 61 as identifying would overstate what
;; this catalog proves -- which is the error this field exists to prevent.
;;
;; Substrings are taken from the RAW response body and were each checked against
;; the fetched bytes before this file was written (2026-08-22, GLEIF golden copy
;; of 2026-08-21). The child-count and isin-count rows go red when GLEIF adds or
;; removes a relationship; that is correct DRIFT, not a false alarm. GLEIF
;; escapes URL slashes in its JSON (in\/L65920..., https:\/\/...); the ocid,
;; ra-website and lou-website rows match that raw escaped form deliberately.
{:catalog/subject
 #:company{:legal-name "HDFC BANK LIMITED"
           :lei "335800ZQ6I4E2JXENC50"
           :jurisdiction "IN"
           :registered-at "RA000394"
           :registered-as "L65920MH1994PLC080618"
           :legal-form "NBCI"
           :website "https://www.hdfc.bank.in/"}
 :catalog/authorities
 [{:authority/id :gleif
   :authority/name "Global Legal Entity Identifier Foundation"
   :authority/root "https://api.gleif.org/"}
  {:authority/id :us-sec
   :authority/name "U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, EDGAR"
   :authority/root "https://data.sec.gov/"}
  {:authority/id :issuer
   :authority/name "HDFC Bank Limited, at its own published website"
   :authority/root "https://www.hdfc.bank.in/"}]
 :catalog/unreachable
 [{:unreachable/authority "Companies Register, Ministry of Corporate Affairs (RA000394)"
   :unreachable/url "https://www.mca.gov.in/"
   :unreachable/observed "HTTP 403 to this gate's client (2026-08-22); the per-entity View Company Master Data lookup runs behind POST/captcha flows"
   :unreachable/consequence "The register GLEIF names as this entity's register of record and validation authority is NOT cited below. The CIN L65920MH1994PLC080618 rests on GLEIF alone."}
  {:unreachable/authority "NSE / BSE listing records (ticker HDFCBANK)"
   :unreachable/url "https://www.nseindia.com/"
   :unreachable/observed "per-entity quote data sits behind POST/JS-gated APIs"
   :unreachable/consequence "Rejected deliberately. A search-echo row would pass forever and prove nothing. The listed-company corroboration below comes from the US SEC instead (NYSE-listed ADS, ticker HDB)."}]
